    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d04cf3500d4eb9fd7228fe9a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而名将怒涛则是有些冒失的赛马娘。\n虽然还没有创下过优异的成绩，\n不过听说她似乎颇具潜力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e00251f6041fb05f0dad29ef4e5860eb976c519638515d8f9747f922cbd09765",
